NAME: ALICIA GARONE

366
00:25:23,166 --> 00:25:24,875
[Morell] The girl's under surveillance.

367
00:25:27,541 --> 00:25:29,666
[Anna chuckles incredulously]

368
00:25:33,666 --> 00:25:34,875
